-
----
-
-## Execution rule
-
-For every task:
-1. identify the system
-2. identify the chokepoint
-3. identify the beneficiary
-4. isolate the leverage point
-5. choose the right pillar
-6. choose the right visual family
-7. choose the right title engine
-8. enforce the color meaning system
-9. enforce retention logic
-10. check trust impact before finalizing
